  "prefLabel": "Ac 105.02 Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 105.02 Quorum. A quorum of the board consists of a majority of the board members then in office, pursuant to RSA 309-B:4, II(b). A vote of the majority of those voting, is necessary for board action on anything requiring a vote of the board.\n\nSource. #10053, eff 1-1-12",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ac100-500.html"
